<p><strong><span>接收条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQam5Qv6zppmpBLAHWTLvpoI0RJTRicUiaicLL77O4WfXT0EEYM3wVMhpYCoDfGJoQUeuScicMxqMaVxmNGTEYXdKtiaeU41Jx6Lgek/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQibvOExpSFfIfWBkasg32aYxWF8TBBeqLBy8U5XWuGG6sVfFc5giatCFGiaVUuXwvnQfE1WTfRmfPicyeY7KJXoj9OuP7LL3S8Y4o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQhu9XcpicgfS05ic2oWSE5Lm04G74eohLwUbfTtMwGkyCX9GxjO5ic5QmTM14tUy1aKbxIAm2at3NbkuE4nvEaPZgjtvp0j81QiaU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQUFDqc1tt56iciaL8UiacXInoOiaHfp8hdaO8A7q8ukGODIV68tIeFhic0BbwtPJrG6B80zkRefA1pN8BicibDJPF5BicqkOvV7ib0icjIM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，且获得所在学校的推荐免试资格（如暂未确定推荐免试资格，也可先行报名）。</span></p><p><span>1. 具备以下条件之一者，在同等条件下优先接收：</span></p><p><span>（1）在国内外公开出版的刊物上，以第一作者身份发表与申请专业相关的学术论文；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科期间获得省级及以上个人奖项，或作为主要完成人获得集体奖项。</span></p><p><span>2. 直博生接收条件：本科期间学习成绩优秀，专业排名名列前茅，具有突出的研究潜质，申请我院环境科学与工程一级学科博士学位授权点的学术学位硕士推免生，通过推免生接收考核后，可在教育部推免系统中填报直博生。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYRCB3kgacRcAEqJ2PibmYFXWky2rEiblYH2RwRb97gI7Ism6vaWvLPG5h1SEbicTNtCGAQZdAkQvxSXjCVMicZPmJIWoAkd4gu6K5o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/VexjasnryYT2ATXK7I4j7F3VMOIIwXGmC9n81xk0Hc4LVcddLh92Cq9kWGSfUzFgo54ZFOdNL1ucibCmop5nrhaKIhXDxIo4vEUcUGFI1y68/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>支持政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYSDydgiaRjo39pzGplSFwYJ68WZIicluzulib3wdcKVJZZqJKo6OiaLXfkq631Vty2BtfJFoQiapeLzeIpicCKic7lg8aqXsOALz4n7E4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQgjAztZ0FdXL3mlpcIEW1FPuh49Muxqic100ibcZRU7j7bwohjMgOiayHsoIEu0RCrSNib43jLqjDR4pFNYaRmkokvXgywVJJcq2s/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQzKtgr2s0xwJNILfHLPuuVEIVJwFdjUdDsKrZJtRFCmHsj1TI8k9m0icbsgQxPA6rlohoZD3VRsibCzETZOL2roicrXc7vqdB3N4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYRrpOHFTiaU5WpZ8ZAG0oxvicicnvE4BU99EfXHIZGSf0Yn3tAfpKI7XWpLE6ibVWAIqGo8CAxFS25jb9AiaA3qEGaM1dJPeIXofvao/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 享受最高等级学业奖学金。推免生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受硕士研究生最高等级学业奖学金；直博生报到入学后，第一学年可直接享受博士研究生最高等级学业奖学金。</span></p><p><span>2. 优先选择导师。推免生新生入校后享有优先选择导师的权利。</span></p><p><span>3. 补贴考试费用。参加复试的推免生免缴考试费。</span></p><p><span>4. 本硕贯通培养。本校推免生录取后可经遴选后进入本硕贯通培养通道，大学四年级提前进入硕士阶段学习，并有资格在硕士一年级通过硕博连读选拔录取为博士研究生。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQ1WdZeqxLPv3yeaVbWYta5jGIOPfvrsbKzOY2EyXcCwuFgSesLj2NFhIGB7zicTuxby2lDlTJia1Azq188E3iaQ3zRDzhE8JmZdo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/VexjasnryYR8KRw0qLyUzVnXatk0KvicG6JZHvUJy3M0zGKXOhYD9BHwzMGnQiaMofkhpGkS1ukjgibo0hibJIdhvknNp2skicvnibONMqe43dzb8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYRibVDYJ3kR3IFib2D2ZRQteVW2t1gu7Irbw7vh6TbwrlXzrMGNKoUU2BjUBSfEIjFL5lT35RDxIYgb3VHQqJMYVYJicBKOiaHtLcY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYS2ZV3L3stD9yGDzZGAxVFGREeibCnOHCJMuicWwia6XHckLsGibB4iaG9QtTsJnlOx0e1PqsbepCGmd6YAlYnN3pr2Cc9aJaJLjib44/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYSfdhc54r5ooTZG9oXsjoq318Hdc2XHUZSrRNyDoic1DalLtXdT9C8xxmfBV7icyOHCMktZLc4RsYOERHFsH3w7IictOMy7KiaCHzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYSsQJprCZGadbibxqsRUuncp9kKBUKxI73CKN5j7cYB8g9gbP85ZKVUsIz4cBU9chFJYlh3oBc4GicjsQYQRroCVNuwjMaQKIS4I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 预报名时间为2026年7月20日至9月20日（暂定）。请符合报名条件的考生登录我校推免生申请系统(https://yz.njnu.edu.cn/sstm/)进行预报名。</span></p><p><span>2. 通过本系统进行预报名且符合接收条件的学生，将优先安排复试、优先接收。</span></p><p><span>3. 通过本系统预报名并取得推免生资格的学生，待教育部开通推免生报名系统后（预计2026年9月下旬），仍须在教育部的推免系统中完成填报志愿等相关操作，否则申请无效。教育部推免系统开放后，申请者应根据学院的要求在规定时间内完成报名、接受复试通知、接受待录取通知等操作。学院将根据复试成绩择优录取，录满为止。</span></p><p><span>4. 理工科应届本科毕业生在推免生申请系统中填报我校理工科硕士研究生或教育硕士专业学位研究生，可同时申请我校“国优计划”专项。有关“国优计划”专项研究生的具体事宜见我校后续通知。</span></p><p><span>5. 因上级教育主管部门相关文件暂未下达，预报名系统中所列的专业信息及相关推免政策可能会有所调整。实际招生专业和研究方向以学校正式发布的2027年招生简章和专业目录为准（预计于2026年9月发布），最终录取专业以教育部推免系统内的待录取确认结果为准。</span></p><p><span>6. 我校将根据教育部关于推免生接收的最新政策，在研究生招生网公布2027年接收推免生的最新信息，请考生及时关注。本通知内容若与上级教育主管部门后续印发文件不一致，以上级最新正式文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYRqo44vKPPJH6WRhFExkmMcnbMPmdONUIDSibnfeITU8KCNiafuq9NtiaGfGok9MfFvsrX6jAN77Sr8thSLytAGOb9JMkGLN9j7z4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYTNlj2mTia3VZSwibXpiawMEOuttaZwiaxKeGnYQZsj1WAjnf1iaEqZyM0mq4kY8IpmRRJOKCAlvtxKfbrVibNl3iaT9nXcyBIic8XoEjg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYTylQA0mDz88mcfIBkPkO4Q3StjvVgVH18iblmHdzookfr1Oonom2lrQg3oI7WqFRhZuh4icw9GiaKhE249EzYGTSVmzdI7ElNGXo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYShQlsufopdUIUibIeNqDUHOb0zQu4KNcTb1EKvestpurIiaCyluFF6ytYsqgQcjbrBddiaEAqHFxpTRza028afV2ndB3sGiawWJ40/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>热忱欢迎广大推免生积极报名南京师范大学环境学院，为改善人类生存与发展的环境质量、推进生态文明建设和美丽中国建设贡献智慧与力量。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>        南京师范大学环境学院</span></p><p><span>               2026年8月</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYTNIJGXia7psFTf0yDiaOb6Uia9micOyzvZFUvlAbgnAOsRLt4ibtglrfCy3WrfLiaTNY4PE3fhhCxGNQwJ0QDP3tp7Dmzialrv1d7jsE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYS6VpzeZePwvAmiczj0fxFJTgnH5Fr6Cwk0BQZSrKiaFLA4ZxLYayiaVzlZxybRNb0dT3iciaWUFPqCJLTQ5pNIAxuia7SWRc089a7u4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQSLPFcQaXcedgeBpWyRVktvqulFDRknX4fWL1ACnpXxtpAl141pBrxF1Qm8mNDZfkHWLFjCnN53ibwu9Gzso3A9HDn1NwKy8x0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/VexjasnryYQkTjXL4H25jvupgQNaNGS04sXEicB6P31icnXqtWNicHhg4tk5uIKiazAJT4OibNESBJkIlv9t6nfHsPaWDiaiaVegyUNicXNa8fricB9M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p>